{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>דרך</b> (Derekh) — the opposite of דרך שקר. The sense of אמונה is that there is no injustice in our hands; therefore he said: משפטיך שויתי, like לא ישוו בה. And the meaning: I have made equal judgment."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 119, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:40:19.182916675Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}